criptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"-0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"-0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"-0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mtable columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>96</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mn>216</mn></mstyle></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"27\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cD7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>216.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, there are <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"28\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>216</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> cakes in total.</p>\n</div></div>             \n\n                           \n                    </div>",
