    "q-133806": {
      "dom_id": "question-133806",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "Of the $2$ of Darryl's cherry pies, Ellen takes $\\frac{5}{7}$ of a pie. As a mixed number, Darryl has\n\n                            \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \ncherry pies left.",
      "worked_solution": "To find out how much cherry pie Darryl has left, we must calculate the difference $2-\\frac{5}{7}.$\n\nTo subtract $\\frac{5}{7}$ from $2,$ we need to express the whole number $2$ as an equivalent fraction with a denominator of $7.$\n\nFirst, we write $2$ as an improper fraction:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{1}\n$$\n\nThen, we put this fraction over a denominator of $7$ by multiplying the numerator and denominator by $7:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{2\\times 7}{1\\times 7}=\\frac{14}{7}\n$$\n\nSo now, we have to find:\n\n$$\n\\frac{14}{7}-\\frac{5}{7}\n$$\n\nTo subtract two fractions with like denominators, we subtract the numerators and keep the denominators the same. Therefore:\n\n$$\n\\frac{14}{7}-\\frac{5}{7}=\\frac{14-5}{7}=\\frac{9}{7}\n$$\n\nFinally, we convert to a mixed number:\n\n$$\n9÷7=1\\,\\text{R}\\,2=1\\,\\frac{2}{7}\n$$\n\nTherefore, Darryl has $1\\,\\frac{2}{7}$ cherry pies left.",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "field-1",
          "type": "blank",
          "dom_id": "",
          "tag": "mathquill",
          "choices": [],
          "dom_index": 0,
          "disabled": false,
          "input_html": "<div class=\"matheditor-wrapper-answer\" style=\"min-width: 30px; margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 2px;\">\n                                             \n                                        <div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"9\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"39\">1</span><span class=\"mq-fraction mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"41\"><span class=\"mq-numerator\" mathquill-block-id=\"43\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"42\">2</span></span><span class=\"mq-denominator\" mathquill-block-id=\"45\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"44\">7</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0\">​</span></span></span></div></div>",
